      <span class="eyebrow">The Breed</span>
      <h2>Born for the forest</h2>
      <p>The Norwegian Elkhound (Norsk Elghund Grå) was shaped over thousands of years to hunt moose in dense Nordic forest — independent, enduring, and bonded to the people who work beside them.</p>
      <p>Courage, intelligence, loyalty and stamina define the breed. A thick weatherproof coat and keen senses make them as at home in deep winter as they are by the hearth.</p>
      <p class="tagline-text tagline-text--lg">"They don't just work in the forest. They belong there."</p>
    </div>
