      <h2>Quality over quantity</h2>
      <p>We are a small kennel in Norrbotten, breeding with respect for the working heritage of the Norsk Elghund Grå — sound health, true type, hunting instinct, and a temperament that is a joy to live with.</p>
      <ul class="kennel-points">
        <li>Health-tested breeding with strong conformation</li>
        <li>FCI breed standard and natural working ability</li>
        <li>Raised as family — ethical, transparent, lifelong support</li>
        <li>Carefully planned litters, not volume</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
